{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001800667","cik":"0001800667","slug":"jfrog-800667","name":"JFrog Ltd","ticker":"FROG","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sic":"7372","country":"CA","website":"","listed_years":5.5,"first_annual":"2021-02-12","last_filing":"2026-07-28","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001800667&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["JFrog Ltd files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $540.5m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 25.8% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 78.2%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($83.5m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 25.8% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $154.0m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"},{"text":"Gross margin of 78.2% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 75.3% to 78.2% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $83.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"},{"text":"Net cash of $741.2m against total assets of $1.4bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-8.4% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 5.9% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000119312526214647/0001193125-26-214647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-214647"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 3.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (584,847 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1800667/000122734826000008/0001227348-26-000008-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 70.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","co